step The Jadefire moonwell
  tip Ride north-west past Jaedenar to the corrupted moonwell of the Jadefire satyrs and fill Winna's flasket there.
  use 12566 quest 4505.1 @32.3,66.6 map 1448
  collect 12567 quest 4505 @32.3,66.6

step Bloodvenom Post
  tip North up the road to Bloodvenom Post.
  turnin 6162                         -- Dreka'Sur
  turnin 4505
  turnin 86612                        -- Winna Hazzard: the Stag Lord's Bauble
  accept 4506
  turnin 4521                         -- Trull Failbane
