step Winna's kitten
  tip Take the kitten back to the Jadefire moonwell and release it there with Winna's Kitten Carrier; once it has turned into a Corrupted Saber, bring it back to Winna and click on it to hand it over.
  use 12565 quest 4506.1 @32.3,66.6 map 1448 -- Winna's Kitten Carrier, at the Jadefire moonwell
  complete 4506 @34.26,52.32 map 1448 era -- Bring the Corrupted Saber to Winna Hazzard at Bloodvenom Post and click on it to hand it over.

