# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Feralas

step Evoroot
  when onquest 3909
  tip The Evoroot grows inside a ruined building north of Gregan's camp, east of the harpies' Ruins of Ravenwind: climb in through the broken part of its wall.
  tip Or the front door: Miblon Snarltooth guards it, and the Bait Gregan sells draws him off when you use it beside him. Half the players in our recordings went in that way, half through the wall.
  collect 11242 @44.5,10.2 map 1444

step The Videre Elixir
  when has 11242
  tip Back south to Gregan. Keep the elixir and don't drink it yet: it kills you, and that is how you meet Gaeriyan by Gadgetzan later.
  turnin 4041 direct -- Gregan Brewspewer
  collect 11243 quest 3909.1            -- Videre Elixir, Gregan's reward

step Desolace
  zone Desolace
  goto 21.6,74.0 "Shadowprey Village"

step Fly to Thunder Bluff
  zone Desolace
  goto 21.6,74.0 "Shadowprey Village flight master"
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  zone Thunder Bluff

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thunder Bluff

step Bluff Runner Windstrider
  accept 1000
  tip Bluff Runner Windstrider and Rumstag Proudstrider stand on the central rise, not on Hunter Rise. Each of Rumstag's donations takes sixty Wool, Silk or Mageweave from your bags: hand in what you carry, skip the rest.
  turnin 7820 direct optional
  turnin 7821 direct optional
  turnin 7822 direct optional

step Ghede
  when complete 3761
  tip Ghede stands on Elder Rise.
  turnin 3761                         -- Ghede

step Elder Rise
  accept 3782                         -- Arch Druid Hamuul Runetotem
  turnin 1000
  accept 1123
  train class only Druid,Paladin      -- Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise; Alodan the Hopeful
  note Rabine Saturna waits in Moonglade: keep it for later.

step Bashana Runetotem
  tip Hand Bashana the Seed Voucher for her packets of Tharlendris Seeds. Morrowgrain Research gives you the Evergreen Pouch: use it with a seed packet and two Un'Goro Soil in your bags to grow a random herb, sometimes Morrowgrain, once every ten minutes. She wants ten, so the quest is optional: take it if you have spare Un'Goro Soil and want to keep growing it over the next guides.
  turnin 3782
  accept 3786 optional
  complete 3786 optional
  turnin 3786
  collect 11040 x10 optional

step Bashana Runetotem
  when has 11040 x10
  turnin 3804 direct

step Magatha Grimtotem
  when onquest 3518
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Magatha Grimtotem stands on Elder Rise.
  turnin 3518                         -- Delivery to Magatha, from Jediga in Azshara
  note Magatha's payment goes back to Jediga in Azshara, which the route doesn't pass again: leave it.
